IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `il38-nouns`

-- Every cross-reference of the Courts Law provisions in scope (ss 6, 6B, 6C, 8, 14, 25), as typed values a test checks. Row IL-38.
-- `what the citing text says it points at` is read from Amendment No. 105 (SH 3389 pp. 438-440, page images) or, for a section the Amendment did not touch (s 14), from the consolidation.
-- `what the cited provision deals with` is the target's own wording: for the Basic Law, SH 3388 p. 434 (row IL-37); for the Knesset Law ss 6 and 61, the Wikisource consolidation (an AID: CONSOLIDATION-ONLY).

§ `The cross-references`

-- s 6, opening: הועדה לבחירת שופטים שלפי סעיף 4 לחוק־יסוד: השפיטה. Target: Basic Law s 4, the committee.
`xref s 6 to Basic Law s 4` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` OF "Courts Law s 6", "Basic Law: The Judiciary s 4", `the Judicial Selection Committee`, `the Judicial Selection Committee`

-- s 6(2) and s 6(3B): ואם התקיימו הוראות סעיף 4(ו) לחוק־יסוד: השפיטה. Target 4(f): מנו סיעות הקואליציה יותר מ־80 חברי הכנסת, יחולו על הוועדה הוראות סעיף זה בשינויים אלה.
`xref s 6(2) to Basic Law s 4(f)` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` OF "Courts Law s 6(2)", "Basic Law: The Judiciary s 4(f)", `the variations that apply where the coalition factions number more than 80 Knesset members`, `the variations that apply where the coalition factions number more than 80 Knesset members`

`xref s 6(3B) to Basic Law s 4(f)` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` OF "Courts Law s 6(3B)", "Basic Law: The Judiciary s 4(f)", `the variations that apply where the coalition factions number more than 80 Knesset members`, `the variations that apply where the coalition factions number more than 80 Knesset members`

-- s 6B(a): החברים המנויים בסעיף 4(ב)(1)(ב) עד (ד) לחוק־יסוד: השפיטה. Targets: the ministers, the Knesset members, the public representatives.
`xref s 6B(a) to Basic Law s 4(b)(1)(b) to (d)` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` OF "Courts Law s 6B(a)", "Basic Law: The Judiciary s 4(b)(1)(b) to (d)", `the members that are not judges: ministers, Knesset members, public representatives`, `the members that are not judges: ministers, Knesset members, public representatives`

-- s 6B(c)(2): הודיעה ועדת הכנסת, לפי סעיף 61 לחוק הכנסת, התשנ״ד–1994, על פרישתו של חבר הכנסת המכהן בוועדה לבחירת שופטים מסיעתו. Target, Knesset Law s 61, heading פרישה מסיעה.
`xref s 6B(c)(2) to Knesset Law s 61` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` OF "Courts Law s 6B(c)(2)", "Knesset Law s 61", `a Knesset member's secession from a faction`, `a Knesset member's secession from a faction`

-- s 6C(a): כשיר להתמנות לשופט בית המשפט העליון כאמור בסעיף 2. Target, Courts Law s 2: the eligibility of a Supreme Court judge.
`xref s 6C(a) to Courts Law s 2` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` OF "Courts Law s 6C(a)", "Courts Law s 2", `the eligibility of a Supreme Court judge`, `the eligibility of a Supreme Court judge`

-- s 6C(b): הוראות סעיף 6 לחוק הכנסת, התשנ״ד–1994, יחולו לעניין נציגי הציבור בוועדה. Target, Knesset Law s 6, heading בחירת נציגים: the Knesset's rules for the election of its members to a committee
-- (s 6(a)(4) names the Judicial Selection Committee; Amendment No. 105 s 7 changed s 6(b) to "the members of the committee elected in the Knesset").
`xref s 6C(b) to Knesset Law s 6` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` OF "Courts Law s 6C(b)", "Knesset Law s 6", `the election of its members to a committee`, `the election of its members to a committee`

-- s 8(a), from the 26th Knesset: לפי הוראות סעיף 4(א) ו־(ד) לחוק־יסוד: השפיטה. Targets: 4(a) appointment of a judge on the committee's election; 4(d) the ordinary decision majority.
`xref s 8(a) to Basic Law s 4(a)` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` OF "Courts Law s 8(a)", "Basic Law: The Judiciary s 4(a)", `appointment of a judge on the committee's election`, `appointment of a judge on the committee's election`

`xref s 8(a) to Basic Law s 4(d)` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` OF "Courts Law s 8(a)", "Basic Law: The Judiciary s 4(d)", `the ordinary decision majority of Basic Law s 4(d)`, `the ordinary decision majority of Basic Law s 4(d)`

-- s 14(a): הצעה לסיים את כהונתו של שופט לפי סעיף 7(4) לחוק־יסוד: השפיטה. Target, Basic Law s 7(4): the committee's decision to end a judge's term.
`xref s 14(a) to Basic Law s 7(4)` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` OF "Courts Law s 14(a)", "Basic Law: The Judiciary s 7(4)", `ending a judge's term by decision of the committee`, `ending a judge's term by decision of the committee`

-- s 25(b): שופטים שכיהנו בבית משפט מחוזי במשך תקופה כאמור בסעיף 2(1). Target, s 2(1): מי שכיהן במשך תקופה של חמש שנים כשופט בית משפט מחוזי.
`xref s 25(b) to Courts Law s 2(1)` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` OF "Courts Law s 25(b)", "Courts Law s 2(1)", `the five years' service as a judge of a district court`, `the five years' service as a judge of a district court`

GIVEN ref IS A `A cross-reference`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the cross-reference agrees` MEANS
    ref's `what the citing text says it points at` EQUALS ref's `what the cited provision deals with`

GIVEN refs IS A LIST OF `A cross-reference`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`every cross-reference in the list agrees` MEANS
    CONSIDER refs
    WHEN EMPTY THEN TRUE
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN `the cross-reference agrees` r AND `every cross-reference in the list agrees` rest

`the cross-references of the Courts Law provisions in scope` MEANS
    LIST `xref s 6 to Basic Law s 4`,
         `xref s 6(2) to Basic Law s 4(f)`,
         `xref s 6(3B) to Basic Law s 4(f)`,
         `xref s 6B(a) to Basic Law s 4(b)(1)(b) to (d)`,
         `xref s 6B(c)(2) to Knesset Law s 61`,
         `xref s 6C(a) to Courts Law s 2`,
         `xref s 6C(b) to Knesset Law s 6`,
         `xref s 8(a) to Basic Law s 4(a)`,
         `xref s 8(a) to Basic Law s 4(d)`,
         `xref s 14(a) to Basic Law s 7(4)`,
         `xref s 25(b) to Courts Law s 2(1)`
